{
  "name": "cancelled-run",
  "about": "A run somebody cancelled (PRD resolved q75, Decision D160) while its `code` node was running. The root span is UNSET — a cancel is neither a success nor something that went wrong, and `agentcompose.status` says `cancelled` — and carries no status message, because a cancelled envelope carries no `error`. The node the cancel stopped is an UNSET span whose `agentcompose.outcome` says `cancelled`, with no `agentcompose.error`; the instance's `finally:` node, which a cancel never stops, ran after it and completed.",
